Privacy Policy
Effective Date: November 4, 2025
We respect your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how Yoga with Leo operates, what
information is (and is not) collected, and how subscriptions are handled through Apple App Store
and Adapty.
Overview
We do not collect, store, or process any personally identifiable information.
The Application works entirely on your device and does not require account creation or login.
Interpretation and Definitions
• Application — refers to Yoga with Leo, the mobile software program provided by the
Company.
• Company (also “we”, “us”, or “our”) — refers to the publisher of Yoga with Leo.
• Device — any device that can access the Service such as a smartphone or tablet.
• Service — refers to the Application.
• You — the individual using the Service.
In-App Purchases and Subscriptions
The Application may offer auto-renewable subscriptions or one-time in-app purchases to unlock
premium content.
• Billing and renewal: Payment is charged to your Apple ID at confirmation of purchase.
Subscriptions renew automatically unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before
the end of the current period.
• Manage or cancel: You can manage or cancel your subscription anytime in your App Store
account settings. Turning off auto-renew stops future renewals; the current period remains
active until it expires.
• Free trials: If offered, unused portions of a trial are forfeited once a subscription is
purchased. Trials convert to a paid plan unless canceled ≥ 24 hours before the trial ends.
• Pricing and refunds: Prices vary by region and may change. Refunds are handled by Apple
under App Store policy; we cannot issue refunds directly.
• Purchase data: We receive limited, non-personal transaction metadata from Apple (for
example, product ID and purchase status) solely to maintain premium access.
• Legal: Use of subscriptions is also subject to the Apple Media Services Terms and the Apple
EULA.
Purchase and Revenue Analytics (Adapty)
To maintain subscription functionality and analyze anonymous purchase statistics, the Application
uses Adapty.
Data handled by Adapty may include:
• product identifier;
• purchase date;
• subscription status (active/expired);
• region and revenue amount (aggregated).
This information is provided by Apple App Store via secure, anonymized channels and does not
include any personal identifiers such as name, email, or Apple ID.
Purpose of use:
• verify access to paid content;
• analyze overall conversion and subscription performance;
• ensure stable operation of in-app purchases.
We do not use Adapty data for advertising, behavioral profiling, or cross-app tracking.
Adapty Privacy Policy: https://adapty.io/privacy/
Use of Data
All automatically received data are:
• anonymized and limited to what is technically required for subscription verification;
• stored and processed by third-party services (Apple and Adapty) under their own privacy
terms;
• never combined with other information to identify you.
We do not share, sell, or use data for personalized ads or marketing.
Subscription Terms
• Trial access: A free or paid trial may be offered. Unless canceled before the trial ends, it
converts automatically to the paid plan shown on the purchase screen.
• Renewal: Subscriptions renew automatically at the chosen interval (weekly, monthly, or
yearly) until canceled.
• Cancellation: Turn off auto-renewal ≥ 24 hours before the period ends to avoid being
charged again.
• Payment method: Charges are processed via your Apple ID account at confirmation, at the
end of trial, and on each renewal.
• Refunds: Refunds are governed by Apple App Store policy. Partially used periods are non-
refundable.
• Price changes: We may adjust prices; new rates apply from the next billing cycle.
Promotional offers may be available for limited time.
Links to Other Websites
The Application does not display advertising or external links, except official links to Apple App
Store and Adapty privacy pages. We are not responsible for content on external sites.
Changes to this Policy
We may update this Policy occasionally. Updates are posted on this page with a new effective date.
Continued use of the Application after changes means you accept the revised Policy.
